    "honesty": "Every frequency here is a real value returned by the Ensembl 1000 Genomes Phase 3 API; none was invented. SNPs whose Phase 3 frequencies were split across multiple non-reference alleles (e.g. rs2814778 Duffy, rs4988235 LCT, rs1800414) were DROPPED rather than guessed, so the panel is honestly sized. Palindromic (A/T, C/G) SNPs carry palindromic:true and are flagged in the app's show-the-math table because their strand is ambiguous. Continental-scale and educational only; not calibrated to any individual. See aim_panel.README.md for full provenance and method."
